WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.455 --> 00:00:03.685
I challenge your leader to personal combat

00:00:03.685 --> 00:00:05.685
(shouts of encouragement)

00:00:35.765 --> 00:00:36.765
Shields up!

00:00:47.220 --> 00:00:50.460
Have we got the side of a barn? Maybe they could hit that

00:00:50.480 --> 00:00:52.480
(laughs)

00:01:00.060 --> 00:01:01.320
Woah woah

00:01:04.920 --> 00:01:05.880
Steady

00:01:11.040 --> 00:01:12.680
No! Wait!

00:01:22.000 --> 00:01:23.000
It's

00:01:23.315 --> 00:01:24.315
My sister

00:01:30.995 --> 00:01:31.995
Hello brother

00:01:33.325 --> 00:01:34.515
Shall we talk?

00:01:45.260 --> 00:01:47.060
Shall I address you as...

00:01:47.060 --> 00:01:48.600
Megan, let's keep it simple.

00:01:48.940 --> 00:01:50.580
And you otherwise Drago

00:01:50.860 --> 00:01:52.580
Wise (chuckles)

00:01:53.460 --> 00:01:55.695
I expected you to have the same

00:01:55.695 --> 00:01:58.545
opinion of dragons as your brother does.

00:01:59.855 --> 00:02:00.855
Come on.

00:02:11.245 --> 00:02:12.325
Let's go for a walk

00:02:27.765 --> 00:02:28.745
Peter

00:02:28.745 --> 00:02:29.780
How's your sister?

00:02:52.240 --> 00:02:53.240
Which way?

00:02:53.880 --> 00:02:55.240
Okay

00:02:59.300 --> 00:03:00.540
(cheers)

00:03:03.900 --> 00:03:05.660
You're welcome

00:03:06.300 --> 00:03:08.560
They always forget you need four to take me down.

00:03:20.140 --> 00:03:21.140
Sheriff!

00:03:30.720 --> 00:03:32.720
(frustrated grunting)

00:03:34.540 --> 00:03:37.200
You see the dragon shape in the stars?

00:03:40.915 --> 00:03:42.215
Draco

00:03:42.860 --> 00:03:47.760
The eternal resting ground for dragons who are worthy.

00:03:54.080 --> 00:03:56.480
You're worried that you won't gain a place

00:04:15.380 --> 00:04:18.680
Your grandfathers surveyed the Kingdom from the air

00:04:19.160 --> 00:04:21.300
Let me give you a ride, it's faster.

00:04:21.720 --> 00:04:24.820
We can use the time to better understand the bond between us

00:04:25.280 --> 00:04:27.760
I'll take my chances on the ground, thanks.

00:04:27.760 --> 00:04:29.760
When you were born you inherited a gift.

00:04:30.780 --> 00:04:32.720
A dragon hearts power.

00:04:33.600 --> 00:04:36.480
The gift is mine now. We have to save this throne

00:04:36.520 --> 00:04:37.680
Together

00:04:40.120 --> 00:04:43.180
Dragonheart: Battle for the Heartfire on Blu-Ray June 13th

